  "title": "Intel Corporation to Participate in Upcoming Investor Conference",
  "summary": "SANTA CLARA, Calif., August 18, 2026 – Intel Corporation today announced that David Zinsner, executive vice president and chief financial officer, and John Pitzer, corporate vice president, global treasury and investor relations, will participate in a fireside chat on Intel’s business and strategy at the Deutsche Bank's 2026 Technology Conference on August 26 at 10:35 a.m. PDTA live webcast and replay can be accessed publicly on Intel's Investor … The post Intel Corporation to Participate in Upcoming Investor Conference appeared first on Newsroom .",
